-1.0.0
+#
+# THIS is the file you edit to publish an update.
+# Bump the version line, build, upload to itch.io, then commit and push.
+# Running builds fetch this same file from GitHub, compare it with their own
+# copy, and show an update banner if theirs is older.
+#
+# Four parts, major.minor.patch.build. Fewer parts is fine - missing ones
+# count as 0, so 1.0.1 and 1.0.1.0 are the same version.
+# Lines starting with # are ignored.
+1.0.0.0
